## Behavior preservation (non-negotiable)

Every change to this repo — AI-driven or human — follows
[`repo-standards`](https://github.com/Ranzlappen/repo-standards) `PROMPT.md`
rule 2: **100% of original functionality preserved**, target repo analyzed
*before* editing, and a **Repo-specific risks / edge-cases** subsection
included in every PR description and post-task self-check. "None observed"
is acceptable; the heading must be present. Refactoring PRs additionally
enumerate evidence per rule 2's five buckets (UI / URLs / Storage /
Deployment shape / External dependencies); PWA work follows the PWA
Refactor Addendum in `REFACTORING_GUIDE.md`.

